@startuml
' OWNER-MVP-2026-11-04 review: Reference / reusable template. Illustrative contract/model/pattern, not a product release commitment.
title Template example — Event-driven command knowledge states
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0

[*] --> Received
Received --> Refused : invalid / denied / mismatch / stale
Received --> Coordinating : valid intent
Coordinating --> RecordedResult : same-intent recorded outcome
Coordinating --> Committing : current guards permit new publication
Committing --> Confirmed : observed durable commit
Committing --> NoCommit : authoritative rollback / no-commit evidence
Committing --> Reconciling : observation lost
Reconciling --> Confirmed : same identity confirms result
Reconciling --> NoCommit : authoritative absence under guard
Reconciling --> Unresolved : evidence unavailable
Unresolved --> Reconciling : bounded reviewed lookup resumes
Confirmed --> [*]
NoCommit --> [*]
Refused --> [*]
RecordedResult --> [*]

@enduml
